cture-drawer-right"><div class="eds-structure__drawer-content"></div></section><div class="eds-structure__main-mask" data-spec="eds-structure-main-mask"><div class="eds-structure__fixed-bottom-bar-layout-wrapper"><div class="eds-fixed-bottom-bar-layout" data-spec="fixed-bottom-bar-layout"><div class="eds-fixed-bottom-bar-layout__content"><div class="eds-structure__main-container"><main class="eds-structure__main" data-spec="eds-structure-main"><div class="feed-search-page"><div style="overflow-y:auto"><nav aria-label="breadcrumbs" class="discover-breadcrumbs BreadCrumbs-module__discover-breadcrumbs___3IwsQ" data-spec="breadcrumbs" data-testid="breadcrumb-nav"><ol class="breadcrumbs breadcrumb-container BreadCrumbs-module__breadcrumb-container___y-0ge" data-testid="breadcrumb-ol"><li data-testid="breadcrumb-element"><a href="/" data-testid="breadcrumb-item" title="Home">Home</a><span data-testid="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true"><span class="SearchBreadCrumb-module__breadcrumbSeperator___3Sloq">/</span></span></li><li data-testid="breadcrumb-element"><a href="/d/united-states/events/" data-testid="breadcrumb-item" title="United States">United States</a><span data-testid="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true"><span class="SearchBreadCrumb-module__breadcrumbSeperator___3Sloq">/</span></span></li><li data-testid="breadcrumb-element"><a href="/d/ca--san-francisco/events/" data-testid="breadcrumb-item" title="San Francisco">San Francisco</a><span data-testid="breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true"><span class="SearchBreadCrumb-module__breadcrumbSeperator___3Sloq">/</span></span></li><li data-testid="breadcrumb-element"><span aria-current="page" data-testid="breadcrumb-final-element">Ai Events</span></li></ol></nav><div class="SearchPageContent-module__root___1AsQ2 search-base-screen--marmalade-filters"><section class="SearchPageContent-module__searchPanel___3TunM"><div class="search-results-panel-content"><section><header class="search-header"><div class="search-header__result-header search-header__result-header--with-intro"><h1>Ai Events and Things to do in San Francisco, CA</h1><div id="Page intro" data-testid="read-more-content" class="read-more--content read-more--content__clamped read-more--content__clamped--line-count" style="--mobile-val:2;--tablet-val:2;--desktop-val:2"><p>Fueling technical innovation across local tech hubs, ai events and things to do in San Francisco, CA bring together developers, researchers, and entrepreneurs. Meetups frequently take the form of hands-on coding workshops, panel discussions on machine learning ethics, and pitch sessions hosted in incubator spaces. Participants typically connect over open-source projects, neural network frameworks, and emerging generative models shaping the technology landscape.</p><ul class="search-header__generated-points"><li>Collaborative coding sessions emphasize practical applications of neural networks and machine learning pipelines.</li><li>Panel discussions gather industry experts to debate machine learning ethics, automated systems, and data privacy.</li><li>Networking mixers connect software engineers, data scientists, and startup founders within the local tech ecosystem.</li></ul></div></div></header><div style="display:flex"><aside class="filter-panel-desktop-container" data-testid="filter-panel-desktop-container"><div class="filter-panel"><p class="Typography_root__10ijx #13002d Typography_heading-sm__10ijx Typography_align-match-parent__10ijx" style="--TypographyColor:#13002d">Filters</p><div><div class="filterSection" style="--FilterSectionMargin:3rem 0 0 0;--FieldSetLegendPadding:0 0 0.75rem 0;--LiPadding:12px 0 12px 0" data-testid="filter-section__category"><fieldset class="ChoiceList_root__1af33 ChoiceList_small__1af33"><div class="Stack_root__1ksk7" style="--Space:12px"><legend><span class="">Category</span></legend><ul class="filter-choice-items" id="view-more-category"><li><div class="NestedCategoryFilters-module__categoryOption___3lHL4"><